      "title": "怎麼練習",
      "body": [
        "這一課練習「聽」和「讀」同一篇短文。",
        "建議順序：先按 ▶ 聽一次，不看中文；再讀一次英文；最後才看中文確認。",
        "短文用的都是現在簡單式，說每天的習慣。主詞是 she 時，動詞要加 s：she gets、she drinks。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "passage",
      "title": "短文：Amy 的一天",
      "en": "Amy is an office worker in Taipei. She gets up at seven every morning. She drinks a cup of coffee and eats some bread for breakfast. Then she takes the bus to work. Amy works from nine to six. After work, she goes to the gym. She goes to bed at eleven.",
      "zh": "Amy 是台北的上班族。她每天早上七點起床。她早餐喝一杯咖啡、吃一些麵包。然後她搭公車去上班。Amy 從九點工作到六點。下班後，她去健身房。她十一點睡覺。",
      "notes": [
        {
          "en": "get up",
          "zh": "起床"
        },
        {
          "en": "take the bus",
          "zh": "搭公車"
        },
        {
          "en": "after work",
          "zh": "下班後"
        },
        {
          "en": "gym",
          "zh": "健身房"
        },
        {
          "en": "go to bed",
          "zh": "去睡覺"
        }
      ],
      "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/read-1/passage.mp3"
